0,Music of Niger - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Niger,"The Music of Niger has developed from the musical traditions of a mix of ethnic groups: Hausa, the Zarma – Songhai, Tuareg, Fula, Kanuri, Toubou, Diffa Arabs and Gurma, as well as the Boudouma from Lake Chad.",Ha,Niger-Congo
